{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "flatland",
  "version": "${version}",
  "name": "Flatland",
  "description": "[EN] A perfectly flat plains biome flush with sea level, optionally replacing vanilla plains, snowy plains and desert. Issues: https://github.com/Huziyang520/Flatland/issues [CN] 一马平川：与海面齐平的绝对平坦平原群系，可选替换部分原版平原、雪原与沙漠。问题反馈：https://github.com/Huziyang520/Flatland/issues",
  "authors": [
    "Huziyang520"
  ],
  "contact": {
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Huziyang520/Flatland",
    "sources": "https://github.com/Huziyang520/Flatland",
    "issues": "https://github.com/Huziyang520/Flatland/issues"
  },
  "license": "CC0-1.0",
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "environment": "*",
  "entrypoints": {
    "main": [
      "com.huziyang.flatland.fabric.FlatlandFabric"
    ],
    "client": [
      "com.huziyang.flatland.fabric.FlatlandFabricClient"
    ]
  },
  "mixins": [
    "flatland.mixins.json"
  ],
  "depends": {
    "fabricloader": ">=0.19.5",
    "fabric-api": "*",
    "minecraft": "~26.3",
    "java": ">=25",
    "forgeconfigapiport": ">=26.3.1"
  },
  "recommends": {
    "modmenu": "*"
  }
}
